NV_PK(21,{"look up under the eaves these painted wood carvings are not just pretty the hanging posts help carry the weight of the roof to the columns":"","the end of this hanging post is carved like an upside down lotus flower so it is also called a hanging flower gold dragons curl on both sides":"","plaques from qing emperors and later presidents hang one above another in dacheng hall find kangxi's black and gold plaque teacher for all ages":"","look closely at the left side of qianlong's plaque the small words say it was written in the qianlong years in the first month of spring the red square is a seal":"","in the center of dacheng hall stands a spirit tablet for confucius the first teacher there is no statue look up at the eight sided ceiling with a yin yang sign":"","these wooden stands hold the ox pig and goat for the confucius ceremony offering all three together was the highest kind of sacrifice":"","this red wooden column does not go into the ground it stands on an eight sided carved stone base that carries its weight":"","which photo shows the stands for the ox pig and goat":"","which photo shows confucius's spirit tablet":"","which photo shows a hanging post carved like a lotus":""});